settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What connectivity options are available for exporting or viewing data?","text":"<p>The device includes USB, Bluetooth, and Wi-Fi connectivity, enabling easy data transfer and live viewing from smartphones, tablets, or laptops.<\/p>"}},"question_HafWat":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How accurate are temperature measurements, and how does emissivity correction work?","text":"<p>The HG4 delivers an accuracy of ±2 °C or ±2% (whichever is greater). Users can adjust emissivity to match different material surfaces, improving temperature accuracy during measurement.<\/p>"}},"question_pQerKy":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the field of view (FOV) and minimum focusing distance?","text":"<p>The standard lens offers a 25°×19° field of view and a minimum focusing distance of 0.15 m, allowing detailed imaging even at close range.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_4KNXwC","question_jRpfVg","question_6Dcapi","question_ayd7aw","question_ncJ6rQ","question_HafWat","question_pQerKy"],"name":"Collapsible content","settings":{"heading":"ThermalSense HG4 FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"1","full_width":true}}},"order":["main","details","1709104364c0d40924","product_comparison_grid_UpRpHy","recommendations","image_banner_DyTaQa","multi_column_qyRX34","media_grid_dkLe8E","multi_column_F97ChM","faq_zqjTpk"]}